 Command line input:
 > /path/to/crest /path/to/atropisomers_workflow/example/8_9/ts_conformers/crest_ts/geom_ts.xyz --constrain 1,7,8,9,11,16 -v2i -gfn2 --etemp 298.15 --chrg 0 --uhf 0 --noreftopo --opt tight -squick --T 4

  -v2i : iMTD-GC
 Input list of atoms: 1,7,8,9,11,16
 6 of 26 atoms will be constrained.
 A reference coord file coord.ref was created.
 The following will be written to <.xcontrol.sample>:

 > $constrain
 >   atoms: 1,7-9,11,16
 >   force constant=0.5
 >   reference=coord.ref
 > $metadyn
 >   atoms: 2-6,10,12-15,17-26
 > $end
 
